  "body": [
    "About",
    "Brands",
    "Network 10",
    "10 is the home of seriously good entertainment. With over 60 years of entertaining audiences with the best of comedy, drama, news and sport, 10 holds a special place in the hearts and homes of Australians, no matter where they’re watching. Across free-to-air channels 10, 10 Comedy and 10 Drama, on the 10 app or streaming online at 10.com.au, 10 blends funny with fresh, offbeat with downbeat and new formats with classic favourites to deliver audiences the best in premium content. Made for true lovers of entertainment, 10 serves up laughs, delivers the action and informs with insight across a trusted ecosystem of connected content. Driven by an innovative and inclusive spirit, 10 is there to push the boundaries of what’s possible and bring fans together as Australia’s most entertaining network.",
    "10.COM.AU",
    "Network 10 Press"
  ],
